    <briefdescription>
<para>Executes transactions in a pre-determined canonical (deterministic) order. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each transaction is executed only after all earlier-ordered transactions have reached a terminal state (COMMITTED or ABORTED). Ordering is enforced via a sequence number assigned at registration time. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
